### Net for a new two-variant right-anchored drawer

`ZimmDrawer` already is the right-anchored shell, already has the `title`/`labelledBy`/`aria-label` union and `size="small"` (25%, the tier `zimmDrawer.css.ts` explicitly earmarks for "Regional Storefront, Cookies"). `ZimmWishlistAuthDrawer` is the composition precedent (hook owns logic + copy, component is presentational, `finalFocusRef`/`initialFocusRef` wired). `ZimmProductCard` is the discriminated-union-plus-config-table precedent. Missing entirely: any variant-selected *copy*, any dismissal persistence, any cookie/Didomi gate, and any geo/locale prompt.
